# One line rather than a list of extensions, because a list would have to be kept in step with what
# the repository actually contains, and most of these repositories contain only documents so far.
# `text=auto` lets git detect which files are text; `eol=lf` fixes what lands in a working tree on
# every platform, so a checkout on Windows cannot introduce CRLF that the first code commit then
# silently rewrites.
* text=auto eol=lf
